      "message": "docs: restore the release-notes history under 0.14.0\n\nThe 0.14.0 cut replaced RELEASE_NOTES.md with its own section only,\ndropping the earlier releases and the '---' separator release.yml's\npublish job reads to cut this version's notes from the history, so the\nv0.14.0 run built every platform but failed to publish (the release was\nthen published by hand from that run's artifacts). Put 0.14.0 on top of\nthe v0.13.0 history again, separated by '---'.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
